const issueData = [
  ['q683-constants', 'A', 'UNDERSPECIFIED-RADICAL-SIGN',
    'The author only says the composite exponent signs are decided from the radical terms alone; it gives no wrong comparison, threshold or subtraction-order operation. Literal omission of the additive constants leaves -sqrt(2) and -sqrt(3), both negative, rather than the displayed negative/positive pair. Reversing both subtractions could produce that pair, but is not the stated procedure. The refutation that the two actual signs differ is true, not a generative explanation.',
